      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>[He has] with him this &hellip; which he claimed after this, and a \u1e0dam\u0101n &hellip;</li>\n<li>And he demanded from them a fine of a head of cattle, four of them, and he did not consider [?]</li>\n<li>from it at all [any] khaf\u0101ra. The servants ask for the issuance of the obeyed order</li>\n<li>concerning the aforementioned matter, in accordance with justice, so that they should not be made to pay more than the recognised amount</li>\n<li>for a head of cattle, which he stated was lacking, without increase or deduction [?],</li>\n<li>and without injustice; and that his hand be restrained from oppressing them, as an act of justice toward them, God willing.</li>\n<li>Praise be to God alone, and His blessings be upon our lord Mu\u1e25ammad and his progeny.</li>\n<li>God is sufficient for us, and He is the best disposer of affairs.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
